  "instructions": [
    "1. Pour the two example rows into the testimonials list you already keep (see pour), or make list:praise from the ten fields above and give it a gathers block saying which field is which.",
    "2. Keep the person's words and consent first (tool:keep-the-words-a-person-gave), so the row is received.",
    "3. Read the row's words, then say approve, decline or withdraw. To approve, the AI passes the list, its rows and reviewed_words exactly as you read them, and keeps the answer's keep rows in your store, each only where the row still holds its expected value; the call is refused if they differ from the words in the row or if the consent does not allow showing.",
    "4. Read row_id and status (approved, declined or withdrawn). Words changed after approval stop showing until approved again."
